- KamiSama.Chassis.Commons and KamiSama.Chassis.Commons.Abstractions are added for common CRUD usecases.
- KamiSama.Extensions.AutoMapper is added, introducing CreatePatchedMap and JustPatchMembers extensions.
- KamiSama.Extensions.DependencyInjection named mappings are removed as they exists in Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection
- KamiSama.Extensions.DependencyInjection AutoInjectScoped, AutoInjectTransient and AutoInjectSingleton are added.
