- KamiSama.Repositories.EntityFrameworkCore.Initialization.DatabaseInitializerBase.InitializeData and InitializeTestData are renamed to InitializeDataAsync and InitializeTestDataAsync.
- Documentations are updated for KamiSama.Chassis and KamiSama.Templates.
